  "description": "Steve McQueen is the second studio album by English alternative pop band Prefab Sprout, released on 22 June 1985 in the UK by Kitchenware Records. On 3 September 1985, the album was released by Epic Records in the United States as Two Wheels Good in anticipation of legal conflict with the estate of American actor Steve McQueen. The album cover references McQueen's lifelong passion for Triumph motorcycles and his 1963 film The Great Escape.",
